        "id": "d2c0a7a9"
      },
      "source": [
        "$\\alpha + \\beta$ close to but below 1 is standard covariance-stationary GARCH(1,1) behavior\n",
        "(finite long-run variance); values very close to 1 imply highly persistent volatility shocks\n",
        "that decay slowly. The estimated $\\nu$ (degrees of freedom) confirms independently how\n",
        "fat-tailed VCB's returns are.\n"
      ]
    },
