      "source": [
        "**Reading this table:** `kupiec_p` tests total breach count, `christoffersen_p` tests whether\n",
        "breaches cluster in time, `conditional_coverage_p` combines both. A p-value below 0.05 on any of\n",
        "these is evidence against that aspect of calibration; all three above 0.05 is the strongest\n",
        "statement this notebook can make about a VaR level being well-calibrated.\n"
      ]
    },
