      "source": [
        "**On the persistence boundary:** a meaningful share of stocks hit persistence $\\approx 1$\n",
        "exactly (printed above), which sits at the edge of the stationarity condition\n",
        "($\\alpha + \\beta < 1$) for GARCH. This is worth flagging carefully rather than glossing over:\n",
        "it likely reflects the optimizer converging near a boundary in a relatively short sample, and\n",
        "should not be casually read as \"this is a real, stable feature of these specific stocks\" without\n",
        "further testing (e.g. longer samples, or checking whether an IGARCH specification fits\n",
        "significantly better). No sector- or size-based explanation is tested in this notebook, so none\n",
        "is claimed.\n"
      ]
